=== a dark terminal given a light colour ===

 why does the spinner stutter?


Looking for where the spinner is drawn.
$ git status --short
$ go build ./... ✗ exit(1)
start docs
load skills/tidy/SKILL.md

Why it stutters

The spinner is redrawn on every beat, so a tool blocks it:

1. Paint from Screen.paint only
2. Skip rows that did not change

│ Sealed rows are never touched again.

func (self *Screen) paint(rows []string) error {
    // only what changed
    return self.write("row", 42)
}

@@ -1 +1 @@
- self.redrawAll()
+ self.paintChanged()

┌──────┬──────────┐
│ Mode │ Redraws  │
├──────┼──────────┤
│ line │ per line │
└──────┴──────────┘

See the notes (https://example.com/paint).
